{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19897","headline":"远游 · 孟郊","name":"远游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"慈乌不远飞，孝子念先归。\n而我独何事，四时心有违。\n江海恋空积，波涛信来稀。\n长爲路傍食，着尽家中衣。\n别劒不割物，离人难作威。\n远行少僮仆，驱使无是非。\n爲性玩好尽，积愁心绪微。\n始知时节驶，夏日非长辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}